# 🚀 Landing Page SaaS — PDF Summary AI

Claro! Vou te entregar tudo pronto: **HTML + CSS + JS** em um único arquivo (facilita ainda mais o copy-paste), com design moderno, gradientes, animações sutis e uma proposta de valor forte para converter visitantes em clientes.

## 📁 Como usar
1. Crie um novo arquivo chamado `index.html`
2. Cole todo o conteúdo abaixo nele
3. Abra no navegador → **pronto!**

---

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>PaperMind — Transforme PDFs em Inteligência</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  /* ============ RESET & BASE ============ */
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0e17;
    --bg-card: #13192b;
    --accent: #6c5ce7;
    --accent-2: #00cec9;
    --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7 0%, #00cec9 100%);
    --gradient-glow: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(108,92,231,.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
    --text: #e8eaf0;
    --text-muted: #8b94b8;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --radius: 16px;
    --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    --transition: .3s ease;
  }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; font-size: 16px; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, p { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
  a { color: var(--accent-2); text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
  a:hover { color: var(--white); }

  /* ============ SCROLLBAR ============ */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--accent); border-radius: 99px; }

  /* ============ NAV ============ */
  .nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 1000;
    background: rgba(10,14,23,.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.15);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .logo {
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -.02em;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;
    background: var(--gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 12px; padding: .35rem .8rem;
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color .25s; position: relative;
  }
  .nav-links a::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -2px; left: 0; width: 0; height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent); transition: width .3s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent-2); }
  .nav-links a:hover::after, .nav-links a[aria-current="page"]::after { width: 100%; }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem;
    padding: .7rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem; cursor: pointer;
    border: none; transition: all .3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gradient); color: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(108,92,231,.35);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(108,92,231,.5); }
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent; border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--white); }
  .btn-sm { padding: .5rem 1.2rem; font-size: .8rem; }

  /* ============ HERO ============ */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh; display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 80% 50%, rgba(0,206,201,.18), transparent 60%);
  }
  .hero-content { z-index: 1; max-width: 520px; animation: fadeInUp 1s cubic-bezier(.2,1,.3,1) both; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem;
    background: rgba(108,92,231,.2); border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.35);
    color: var(--accent-2); padding: .4rem .9rem; border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .badge svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -.03em;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 480px;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* mockup card */
  .mockup {
    background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.18);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    overflow: hidden; position: relative;
    animation: slideRight 1s cubic-bezier(.2,1,.3,1) both;
    max-width: 460px;
  }
  .mockup-header {
    padding: .8rem 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot.red { background: #ff5f57; }
  .doc.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
  .doc.blue { background: #28c840; }
  .mockup-body { padding: 1.2rem; }
  .pdf-icon { font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: .8rem; opacity:.85; }
  .summary-line {
    display: flex; gap: .6rem; margin-bottom: .6rem;
  }
  .tag {
    background: rgba(108,92,231,.15); color: var(--accent-2);
    padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .quote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding-left: .8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: .6rem;
  }
  .stat-row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
  .stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .2rem; }
  .stat .num { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-2); }
  .stat .lbl { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes slideRight { from { opacity:0; transform:translateX(40px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateX(0); } }

  /* ============ FEATURES ============ */
  .section { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; }
  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .section h2 { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .6rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .section p.sub { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto .6rem; }
  .section .subtitle { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; margin-top: .4rem; }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    transition: transform .3s, border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(108,92,231,.4);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(108,92,231,.12);
  }
  .icon-box {
    width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(108,92,231,.15); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .feature-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .93rem; }

  /* ============ DEMO INTERATIVA ============ */
  .demo-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #111827 100%);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .demo-title { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
  .demo-sub { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto .8rem; }
  .demo-tools {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .demo-input-wrap {
    position: relative; group;
  }
  .demo-input {
    width: 320px; padding: .85rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 2px dashed rgba(108,92,231,.45);
    color: var(--text); font-family: inherit; font-size: .95rem;
    outline: none; transition: border-color .3s;
  }
  .demo-input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .demo-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); opacity:.5; }
  .upload-btn {
    position: absolute; right: -42px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: var(--gradient); color: var(--white); padding: .55rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; font-size: .8rem; cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap; z-index: 10;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(108,92,231,.4);
  }
  .simulate-btn {
    background: var(--gradient); color: var(--white); padding: .85rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer;
    border: none; transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .simulate-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.04); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(108,92,231,.5); }
  .simulate-btn:active { transform: scale(.97); }

  .result-area {
    margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 740px; margin-inline: auto;
    background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.18);
    padding: 2rem; display: none;
    animation: fadeInUp .5s ease both;
  }
  .result-area.show { display: block; }
  .result-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  .sparkle { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .result-title h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .result-meta { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .fake-summary {
    background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.1);
  }
  .fake-summary p {
    padding: .5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .93rem;
  }
  .fake-summary p:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .word-count {
    display: inline-block; background: rgba(0,206,201,.15); color: var(--accent-2);
    padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 99px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600;
    margin-left: .6rem; vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* ============ PRICING ============ */
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .price-card {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.14);
    border-radius: 24px; padding: 2.2rem 1.6rem;
    text-align: center; position: relative;
    transition: transform .3s, border-color .3s;
  }
  .price-card.popular {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(108,92,231,.16), var(--bg-card));
    border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(108,92,231,.2);
  }
  .popular-badge {
    position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--gradient); color: var(--white);
    font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; padding: .3rem .9rem;
    border-radius: 99px; letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .price-card h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
  .price { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .price span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .period { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .features-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 1.6rem; text-align: left; padding: 0; }
  .features-list li {
    padding: .5rem 0; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .6rem;
    font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .features-list li::before {
    content: '✓'; color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 800; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .price-card .cta { margin-top: 1.8rem; }

  /* ============ TESTIMONIALS ============ */
  .testimonial-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .testi-card {
    background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.8rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.1);
  }
  .testi-author {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .9rem; margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }
  .avatar {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .author-info h4 { font-size: .95rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
  .author-info p { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .quote-mark { font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; color: rgba(108,92,231,.35); margin-bottom: .6rem; }

  /* ============ CTA FINAL ============ */
  .final-cta {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1b2a 0%, #0a0e17 100%);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .final-cta::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; right: -80px; top: -80px;
    width: 320px; height: 320px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(108,92,231,.22), transparent 65%);
  }
  .final-cta h2 { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .final-cta p { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto .5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .urgency {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem;
    background: rgba(251,59,59,.12); border: 1px solid rgba(251,59,59,.35);
    color: #ff6b6b; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* ============ FOOTER ============ */
  footer {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.12);
    text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .85rem;
  }
  .footer-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: .8rem; }
  .footer-links a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .85rem; }

  /* ============ TOAST / NOTIFICAÇÃO ============ */
  .toast {
    position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; right: 2rem;
    background: var(--gradient); color: var(--white);
    padding: .8rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    transform: translateY(100px) scale(.9); opacity: 0;
    transition: all .4s cubic-bezier(.3,0,1.4,.2);
    z-index: 9999; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem;
  }
  .toast.active { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
  .toast .check { font-size: 1.4rem; }

  /* ============ RESPONSIVO ============ */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 5rem 1.2rem 4rem; text-align: center; }
    .hero-content { max-width: 100%; }
    .mockup { max-width: 100%; margin: 2rem auto; }
    .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
    .section-header { text-align: center; }
    .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nav-links { gap: 1.2rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .demo-input { width: 100%; }
    .demo-input-wrap { position: static; }
    .demo-input-wrap button { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
    .nav { position: sticky; top: 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="logo">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      PaperMind
    </div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#features">Recursos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#demo">Demo</a></li>
      <li><a href="#pricing">Preços</a></li>
      <li><a href="#login">Login</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Começar Grátis</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="badge">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
      Agora com suporte a 500+ PDFs
    </div>
    <h1>Sua leitura,<br>em segundos.</h1>
    <p>Envie qualquer PDF e receba um resumo inteligente, estruturado e personalizado — ideal para estudos, trabalho ou pesquisa rápida.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary">Ver Demo Mágica ✨</a>
      <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-outline">Quero Assinar ➜</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Mockup interativo visual -->
    <div class="mockup">
      <div class="mockup-header">
        <span class="dot red"></span>
        <span class="dot yellow"></span>
        <span class="dot blue"></span>
        <span style="font-size:.75rem; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:500;">relatório-anual.pdf</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mockup-body">
        <div class="summary-line">
          <span class="pdf-icon">📄</span>
          <span><strong>Finanças</strong> <span class="tag">✔ Financeiro</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-line">
          <span class="pdf-icon">⚡</span>
          <span><strong>Principais Achados</strong> <span class="tag">✔ Executivo</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">"A receita cresceu 12% no último trimestre, impulsionada por expansão internacional."</div>
        <div class="summary-line">
          <span class="pdf-icon">🎯</span>
          <span><strong>Riscos Identificados</strong> <span class="tag">⚠ Atenção</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><div class="num">+85%</div><div class="lbl">Mais rápido que manual</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="num">~2min</div><div class="lbl">Tempo médio</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FEATURES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Tudo o que você precisa<br>num só lugar 🛠️</h2>
    <p class="sub">Funcionalidades pensadas para economizar seu tempo e elevar sua produtividade.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box">🧠</div>
      <h3>Resumo Inteligente IA</h3>
      <p>Nossa IA lê o documento inteiro e gera um resumo claro, priorizando as informações mais importantes automaticamente.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box">🔍</div>
      <h3>Busca Rápida</h3>
      <p>Filtre por tema, seção ou palavra-chave. Ideal quando você precisa apenas daquela parte específica do documento.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box">📊</div>
      <h3>Exportação Fácil</h3>
